### Get all order statuses

GET http://localhost:5000/api/order_statuses
Content-Type: application/json

### Get order status with id

GET http://localhost:5000/api/order_statuses/1
Content-Type: application/json

### Create order status

POST http://localhost:5000/api/order_statuses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "processing",
  "label": "Processing"
}

### Update order status

PUT http://localhost:5000/api/order_statuses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "code": "processing",
  "label": "Processing"
}

### Delete order status with id

DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/order_statuses/1
Content-Type: application/json
